  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards climate solutions for the safeguarding of marine protected areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s central aim is to put in place a clear pathway of the core priority measures for ocean areas, in particular MPA&#x2019;s, to address the effects of climate change and secure resilience, including through scientific information and research. The project will obtain this aim through the development and implementation of a comprehensive climate vulnerability assessment tool and the identification of climate adaptation priorities at an initial 2 UNESCO World Heritage listed MPAs in Mauritania and Greenland, Denmark.</narrative>
  </description>
